      en: ["Inaugurated in June 2021 by the President.", "Spans 400 hectares in its initial phase.", "Located 15 km north of the capital city, Lomé.", "A partnership between Togo and Arise IIP.", "Features a dry port for up to 12,500 containers.", "Focuses on creating a local textile value chain."],
